      "role": "user",
      "content": "Got it, that's a good start. To help the creative team with the visual casting and mood boards, can you get a bit more specific about the \"look\"? \n\nI'm talking about the physical archetypes for each. Like, when we think of those \"Heritage\" customers, what kind of facial features, skin tones, or even general ethnic backgrounds are we leaning into to convey that sense of lineage and established status? And for the \"Urban\" side, what does that demographic typically look like?",
