      "content": "For the \"Old Money\" segment, think clean, classic features: finely-chiseled cheekbones, high-arched brows, a slender nose, and full-lipped mouth. Skin tones are often lighter and more burnished, with a warm undertone. You may also see all European faces in this tier, particularly British, French, and American. Think elegant, refined造型 (style) with a strong emphasis on tailoring and sophisticated grooming.\n\nFor the \"Urban Trendy\" segment, expect a broader range of ethnicities and facial features, reflecting the global and eclectic nature of this demographic. Consider features like darker, edgier brows, sharper cheekbones, and full lips. Skin tones can range from deep bronze to porcelain. The overall look is more androgynous and bold, with a mix of streetwear and high-end infusion. Think contrasty hair colors, statement accessories, and a very active social media presence.",
